        "version": 2,
        "content": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#0b1220;color:#e5e7eb;border:1px solid #1f2a44;border-radius:16px;padding:18px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:6px;\">SmartAdmin Connected Experience \u2014 Navigation</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#a5b4fc;margin-bottom:12px;\">Home \u00b7 Executive \u00b7 Operational \u00b7 Technical. After import, replace {{PORTAL_BASE}} and {{DASHBOARD_ID_NN}}. Metrics work before links are wired.</div>\n<div style=\"height:1px;background:#1f2a44;margin:12px 0;\"></div>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:12px;\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.76);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.20);border-radius:12px;padding:13px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:5px 8px;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#a7f3d0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Home</span><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_00}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Home</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">00 - Home / Introductory</div></div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.76);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.20);border-radius:12px;padding:13px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:5px 8px;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#93c5fd;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Executive</span><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_10}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Exec CC</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">10 - Executive Command Center</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_01}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Platform Value</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">01 - Platform Value Overview</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_11}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Env Health Exec</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">11 - Environment Health Executive</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_12}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Availability</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">12 - Availability and Service Health</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_13}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Capacity Risk</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">13 - Capacity and Risk Overview</div></div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.76);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.20);border-radius:12px;padding:13px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:5px 8px;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#fdba74;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Operational</span><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_20}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Ops CC</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">20 - Operational Command Center</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_03}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Active Alerts</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">03 - Active Alerts</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_02}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Resource Health</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">02 - Resource Health</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_05}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Websites</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">05 - Websites and Services</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_04}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Coverage</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">04 - Coverage, Capacity &amp; Licenses</div></div><div style=\"background:rgba(14,165,233,.25);border:1px solid #38bdf8;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 8px;margin:4px 0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#7dd3fc;margin-right:4px;\">CURRENT</span><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_06}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Access</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">06 - Access and Administration</div></div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.76);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.20);border-radius:12px;padding:13px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:5px 8px;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#fca5a5;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Technical</span><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_30}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Investigation</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">30 - Technical Resource Investigation</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_07}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Collectors</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">07 - Collector Diagnostics</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_08}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Modules</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">08 - LogicModule and Content</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_09}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Adoption</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">09 - Adoption and Optimization</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_31}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Tech Directory</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">31 - Technology Dashboard Directory</div></div></td></tr></table>\n</div>"
