        "name": "Access and Administration \u2014 Read First",
        "description": "Read first guide for this dashboard.",
        "theme": "newSolidDarkBlue",
        "interval": 15,
        "type": "text",
        "timescale": "day",
        "version": 2,
        "content": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.45;background:#0f172a;color:#e5e7eb;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#f9fafb;\">Access and Administration</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:4px;\">Users, roles, groups, and API token hygiene for security and portal administration.</div>\n</div>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:16px;\"><tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;width:33%;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;color:#f9fafb;\">Questions this dashboard answers</div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:12px;color:#e5e7eb;\"><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">How many active vs idle users/tokens?</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Unused roles or empty groups?</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">API-only sprawl?</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;width:34%;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;color:#f9fafb;\">Recommended review flow</div>\n<ol style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:12px;color:#e5e7eb;\"><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><strong>User KPIs</strong> \u2014 Active / API</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><strong>Roles and groups</strong> \u2014 Empty / unused</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><strong>Token idle metrics</strong> \u2014 90-day hygiene</li></ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;width:33%;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;color:#f9fafb;\">Where to go next</div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:12px;color:#e5e7eb;\"><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Adoption \u2014 09 \u2014 idle access trends</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Home \u2014 00</li></ul>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;\">Tip: Empty or zero values may mean healthy state or missing tokens/LogicModules \u2014 confirm before concluding.</div>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n</div>"
      }
    },
